<title>UK: NSW Treasury sets A$100 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>NSW Treasury sets A$100 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW SOUTH WALES TREASURY CORP</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    21.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.17     PAY DATE    21.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.275     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
